    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Tantatya Tope (Tatya Tope) entered Rajasthan in 1858 after the fall of Gwalior. He was finally captured at Sipriya (near Sheopur) and hanged in 1859.",
      "id": "6v7n7cg"
    },
